---
import site from '../data/site.json';
import type {Content,Route} from '../data/types';
import {byId,photos,requestHref} from '../data/catalog.mjs';
import Photo from './Photo.astro';
import PrimaryActions from './PrimaryActions.astro';
import CredentialLogos from './CredentialLogos.astro';
interface Props {content:Content;route:Route;}
const {content,route}=Astro.props;
// Restore only after MGI's dealer apply link and terms are verified.
const showServiceFinance=false;
const serviceFinanceMention=', or ask MGI about Service Finance';
const providerFaqs=content.faqs.map(f=>({...f,answer:showServiceFinance?f.answer:f.answer.replace(serviceFinanceMention,'')}));
const request=requestHref(route);
const pictures=photos(route.page_id);
const moment=(id:string)=>pictures.find(p=>p?.placement_id===id);
const replacements=[['ST-060','Furnace'],['ST-062','Air conditioning'],['ST-066','Heat pump'],['ST-069','Water heater'],['ST-072','Heat-pump water heater'],['ST-075','Mini split']].map(([id,label])=>({label,route:byId(id)}));
const terms=[['Monthly payment','What will you pay each month, and when does the first payment start?'],['Repayment length','How many payments will you make? What happens if you pay early?'],['Interest and fees','What is the annual percentage rate (APR), and which fees apply?'],['Total repayment cost','What will you pay in all, including interest and fees?']];
---
<article class="finance-standard">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap">
<nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Financing</span></nav>
<div class="hero-grid"><div><h1>{content.title}</h1><p class="lede">{content.summary}</p><PrimaryActions label="Financing options" href="#financing-options"/><p class="small-copy">Financing is subject to credit approval and current lender terms. Asking MGI a question is not a credit application.</p></div><Photo image={moment('finance-opening')} caption="A little room to plan." eager tilt={-2}/></div>
<CredentialLogos/>
</div></section>
<section class="section dark" id="answer"><div class="wrap">
<div class="finance-intro"><h2>Start with the system your home needs.</h2><p>Start with what your home needs. Then compare the work, the full price, and how to pay.</p></div>
<div class="finance-story"><Photo image={moment('finance-project')} caption="Keep the little moments in mind." tilt={2}/><div><ol class="finance-points"><li><h3>What do you want to change?</h3><p>Talk about the rooms that are hard to heat or cool, the equipment you have, and what you want from a replacement.</p></li><li><h3>What work is included?</h3><p>Compare the equipment, installation, exclusions, and any work that needs a separate price or another trade.</p></li><li><h3>What is the full project price?</h3><p>Get the total before comparing payment plans. Keep any possible rebate separate until it is confirmed.</p></li></ol><a class="button light" href={request}>Discuss your project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
</div></section>
<section class="section" id="financing-options" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="financing-options-heading"><div class="wrap">
<div class="finance-intro"><h2 id="financing-options-heading">Ask about the financing options for your project.</h2><p>Apply online through Synchrony or Wells Fargo{showServiceFinance&&serviceFinanceMention}. Confirm the available plan and your terms before applying.</p></div>
<div class="finance-provider-grid"><div class="finance-provider-apply"><span class="eyebrow">Credit card financing</span><h3>Synchrony</h3><p>For homeowners who want to apply online for credit card financing. Subject to credit approval and the terms the lender offers you.</p><p class="small-copy">Application link checked November 2, 2026. Ask about your project: <a href={`tel:+1${site.phone.replace(/[^0-9]/g,'')}`}>{site.phone}</a>.</p><div class="actions primary-actions"><a class="button" href="https://www.mysynchrony.com/mmc/S6247534900" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Apply for financing with Synchrony (opens in a new tab)">Apply for financing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div><div class="finance-provider-apply"><span class="eyebrow">Credit card financing</span><h3>Wells Fargo</h3><p>For homeowners who want to apply online for credit card financing. Subject to credit approval and the terms the lender offers you.</p><p class="small-copy">Application link checked November 2, 2026. Ask about your project: <a href={`tel:+1${site.phone.replace(/[^0-9]/g,'')}`}>{site.phone}</a>.</p><div class="actions primary-actions"><a class="button" href="https://retailservices.wellsfargo.com/ahapp/init-app?m=0030086276&amp;l=en_US" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Apply for financing with Wells Fargo (opens in a new tab)">Apply for financing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><a href="https://retailservices.wellsfargo.com/customer/faqs.html" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore lender questions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>{showServiceFinance&&<div style="grid-column:1/-1"><span class="eyebrow">Installment financing</span><h3>Service Finance</h3><p>Service Finance describes its financing as a fixed-amount, fixed-term installment loan. Ask which program applies, what it costs, and whether any promotional deadline is part of it.</p><a href="https://www.svcfin.com/faqs" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore lender questions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>}</div>
<div class="finance-inline-action"><PrimaryActions label="Ask about payment options" href={request}/><p class="small-copy">Approval is not guaranteed. Ask the lender how the application affects your credit before submitting it.</p></div>
</div></section>
<section class="section finance-canvas"><div class="wrap">
<div class="finance-intro"><h2>Look beyond the monthly payment.</h2><p>Financing can spread the upfront cost. Interest and fees can also increase what you pay in total.</p></div>
<div class="finance-story"><div><div class="finance-payment-choice"><h3>Pay upfront or pay over time?</h3><p>Ask about both. Compare what is due now, what fits your budget, and the full cost of each choice. A lower payment alone does not mean a lower price.</p></div><dl class="finance-terms">{terms.map(([title,body],i)=><div><dt><span aria-hidden="true">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span>{title}</dt><dd>{body}</dd></div>)}</dl></div><Photo image={moment('finance-comparison')} caption="Take time for the whole picture." tilt={-2}/></div>
<aside class="finance-promotion"><h3>A promotional deadline matters.</h3><p>If a plan says “no interest if paid in full,” check whether it uses deferred interest. Missing the payoff deadline can mean interest from the purchase date. Minimum payments may not clear the balance in time. Read the actual offer before signing.</p><a href="https://retailservices.wellsfargo.com/customer/faqs.html" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read Wells Fargo’s explanation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></aside>
</div></section>

<section class="section green"><div class="wrap">
<div class="finance-intro"><h2>From your first question to life at home.</h2><p>A clear plan covers the system, the work, and how you will pay.</p></div>
<div class="finance-story"><ol class="finance-steps">{content.sections.map((step,i)=><li><span class="finance-step-number" aria-hidden="true">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div><h3>{step.heading}</h3><p>{step.body}</p></div></li>)}</ol><Photo image={moment('finance-process')} caption="A little room to make something." tilt={2}/></div>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap">
<div class="finance-intro"><h2>Still choosing your new system?</h2><p>Explore the replacement project, then bring your equipment and payment questions to MGI.</p></div>
<nav class="finance-replacement-links" aria-label="Replacement services">{replacements.map(item=>item.route&&<a href={item.route.canonical_route}>{item.label}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</nav>
<div class="finance-rebate"><h3>Rebates are a separate check.</h3><p>Rebate eligibility and financing terms are separate. Check when any rebate could arrive, and keep the full project price in your budget until it is confirmed.</p><a href="/rebates/">Explore rebate questions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
</div></section>
<section class="section finance-canvas"><div class="wrap"><div class="finance-intro"><h2>HVAC financing questions.</h2></div><div class="faq">{providerFaqs.map(f=><details><summary>{f.question}</summary><p>{f.answer}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section dark"><div class="wrap">
<div class="finance-intro"><h2>Make a plan for your home and your budget.</h2><p>You have a home to enjoy. Let’s talk through the project and payment choices so you can decide what comes next.</p></div>
<div class="finance-story"><Photo image={moment('finance-close')} caption="One more hand together." tilt={-2}/><div><h3>Bring your questions. Start with a conversation.</h3><p>Talk with MGI about the system you need, the full project price, and current financing options. Choose how to pay after you understand the terms.</p><PrimaryActions dark label="Talk about financing" href={request}/><p class="small-copy">The office will confirm appointment and visit details. Financing is subject to credit approval and lender terms.</p></div></div>
</div></section>
</article>
<style>
.finance-intro{text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px}.finance-intro h2,.finance-intro p{max-width:none}.finance-intro p{margin:0}.finance-standard .hero h1{max-width:18ch}.finance-story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:72px;align-items:center}.finance-canvas{background:#f2f3ed}.finance-points{list-style:none;counter-reset:point;padding:0;margin:0 0 28px}.finance-points li{counter-increment:point;position:relative;padding:0 0 24px 54px;margin-bottom:24px;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff50}.finance-points li:before{content:'0' counter(point);position:absolute;left:0;top:0;font:600 32px/1.1 Cormorant,Georgia,serif;color:var(--green)}.finance-points h3{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:12px}.finance-points p{margin:0;font-size:16px}.finance-payment-choice{border-left:3px solid var(--green);padding-left:24px;margin-bottom:28px}.finance-payment-choice h3{margin-bottom:12px}.finance-payment-choice p{font-size:16px;margin:0}.finance-terms{margin:0}.finance-terms>div{padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #c8c2b9}.finance-terms dt{font-weight:700;color:var(--teal)}.finance-terms dt span{display:inline-block;font:600 30px/1 Cormorant,Georgia,serif;margin-right:16px}.finance-terms dd{margin:8px 0 0 47px;font-size:16px}.finance-promotion{border-left:3px solid var(--teal);padding:24px 28px;background:var(--warm);margin-top:48px}.finance-promotion h3{margin-bottom:12px}.finance-promotion p{max-width:none;font-size:16px}.finance-promotion a,.finance-provider-grid a,.finance-rebate a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;gap:10px}.finance-provider-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px}.finance-provider-grid>div{border:1px solid var(--teal);border-radius:16px;padding:32px}.finance-provider-grid h3{font-size:36px;margin-bottom:16px}.finance-provider-grid p{font-size:16px}.finance-inline-action{text-align:center;margin-top:32px}.finance-inline-action :global(.actions){justify-content:center}.finance-inline-action p{max-width:none}.finance-standard .finance-steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0}.finance-standard .finance-steps li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:24px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #7b8e36}.finance-standard .finance-step-number{font-size:52px;margin:0}.finance-standard .finance-steps h3{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:12px}.finance-standard .finance-steps p{font-size:16px}.finance-rebate{text-align:center;margin-top:36px}.finance-rebate h3{margin-bottom:12px}.finance-rebate p{max-width:none;font-size:16px}.finance-standard :global(.small-copy){font-size:14px}.finance-standard :global(.faq){width:100%}
@media(max-width:1100px){.finance-story{gap:40px}}
@media(max-width:767px){.finance-story,.finance-provider-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px}.finance-intro{margin-bottom:32px}.finance-standard .hero h1{font-size:48px}.finance-standard .hero :global(.hero-grid){gap:36px}.finance-provider-grid>div{padding:24px}.finance-promotion{padding:24px 20px;margin-top:36px}.finance-standard .finance-steps li{grid-template-columns:48px 1fr;gap:18px}.finance-standard .finance-step-number{font-size:44px}.finance-points li{padding-left:44px}.finance-terms dd{margin-left:0}.finance-standard .finance-steps p{margin-bottom:0}}
</style>
